      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Balaamu Balaki, “Sinnean aba hiji heeda wagiida ea ghwahita ispwa, ak giyeanean heew ispwa ea lagweendi ispwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasinda Balaki gidarukusiinda Balaamu. Ak ghoadayda Balaki ea Balaamu haleanjeeda ghadooweeda, danyagi was heeyda ea lagweenjeanjagi aba uhuumba hiji was heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Balaamu Balaki, “Miinaada aba murdeeda haleanjeadaang'u bea ghadooweeda, ak gaydawa, gwadeepa ghwaan NG'UTAMIIDA daroonyi; ak abeeda gidahiimnaan gaydarukuneey.” Ak gawa ea ghwahita heeda miy ghaang' aba uhuuda heayeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaroonyi ASEETA sea Balaamu; ak ghwalamda Balaamu ak gwayeesha, “Neasinyi heeda wagiida ispwa ak ea naadaydi haleanjeeda ghadooweeda danyagi was heeyda ea lagweenjeanjagi aba uhuumba hijiwas heeda wagiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheanda ghuuta Balaamu, ak gwayeesha, “Biiksiina Balaki; ak girukusi ng'asheesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabiikta gheanyi, ak ging'ulayi, ghamiinaada aba murdeeda haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, niny sea fuga hees sean bea Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'eat ghwasiildeangaaschi, nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Balaki Balaamu, “Ang'iing'i nisinnean naaha? Geayeaneey mwaashta weajoodigeasu, ak ging'ulayi, niidawi ghawooda huumwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha niny ak gwayeesha, “Heapi mamiisean dang'ula, ak gearukuti ng'asheandida iin NG'UTAMIIDA ghuuteanyuuni?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaamu ghwaramoar deabiyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Balaki ak gwayeesha, “Asaha, geamuscheey beeni, ea eahita hich nuut, ak aba hoowa gajamuusa daaha; gaydaaha meatkweeda nyaawa washiini itaanyaawa ak ghwahit, ak ea mwaydaaha sean, ak gimooshteaynean suh aba hoowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat ea ghwahita madamnyeanda Sofimu, ea ghwahita gilingiljeanda Bisga, ak gwasin heeda wagiida ea ghwahita ispwa, ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda danyagi was heeyda ea lagweenjeanjagi aba hiji was heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha Balaki, “Miinaada aba hiji neekeewa haleanjeadaang'u bea ghadooweeda jea eaghwardaan, ak gaydaroonyi aniini NG'UTAMIIDA aba hoowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaroonyi NG'UTAMIIDA sea Balaamu ak ghwayiin ng'asheanda ghuutaanyi, ak gwayeesha, “Biiksiina Balaki ak giyeeshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahita headaanyi, ak ging'ulayi, ghamiinaada aba murdeeda haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda jea eaghwarda, nea gwandeawa fuga hees bea Moabu. Gwayeesha Balaki, “Gwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'at ghwasiildeangaaschi nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Balaki Balaamu, “Asi adumwaashti muuchi, ak ea adiidawi ghawooda muuchi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Balaamu ak ghwasha ak gwayeesha Balaki, “Neada ea mii dayeeshiineey gideaba ‘Gilinyoo ea ng'asheanda jea gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA gaydasin’?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaamu ghwaramoar deaba samwagu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Balaki Balaamu, “Asi, beeni ghamneawa daanyi hich nuut; gwadeepa ghamwas ASEETA gideaba gaymooshteaynean fiisu aba hoowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat Balaki Balaamu ea ghwahita uhuuda giijeeda Beori, was heeteaschi dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Balaamu Balaki, “Asi, sinnean heeda wagiida ea ghwahita ispwa, amang'ata gooyeanean duuh ispwa was heewga, ea lagweendi ispwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasinda Balaki gidarukusiinda Balaamu, ak gweadu haleanjeeda ghadooweeda ak gaba heewi iin hiji was heeda wagiida ea lagweenjeanjagi iin hiji was heeda wagiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
